SUMMARY:🎬Free Movies In the Beach - Fantastic Four + Pre-Dinner/Ice Cre
 am (Queen)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\nOn **We
 dnesday\, July 29th\, join us for Free Movies in The Beach\, with The Fant
 astic Four 2025\, 90% on Rotten Tomatoes.** We will start off with optiona
 l Dinner in the Beach\, followed by optional ice cream\, prior to entering
  Kew Gardens\, where we will settle down for movie start around sunset. Th
 is is an outdoor event. If rain is forecast\, The Beach BIA will reschedul
 e to a later date and I will post a cancellation maximum 3 hours prior.\n\
 n📖 **Plot Summary:** Forced to balance their roles as heroes with the s
 trength of their family bond\, the Fantastic Four must defend Earth from a
  ravenous space god called Galactus and his enigmatic herald\, the Silver 
 Surfer.\n\n🎞️ **View [Trailer](https://youtu.be/Zl63x5nNlxA?si=0oXcke
 fFrcG_BFI5)**\n\n**Know Before You Go**\n\n* **Seating:** Bring your own *
 *blankets or lawn chairs** as no seating is provided.\n* **Weather**: brin
 g an extra sweater/coat and bug spray\n* **Pre-show Activities:** There ar
 e pre-show games\, trivia\, and giveaways starting shortly before sunset.\
 n* **Shop & Win:** You can bring receipts from local Queen Street East bus
 inesses to enter a raffle for prizes sponsored by the Beach BIA.\n* **Food
 :** Pack your own snacks or grab takeout from local Queen Street East rest
 aurants to enjoy as a picnic. You are welcome to join us for dinner before
 .\n*\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes confirming if you will join for din
 ner/ice cream prior**\n* You can also just show up at any of the meeting t
 imes below\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before with my cell and remi
 nder details where to meet and when.\nRSVPs close 1 day prior. cancellatio
 ns will be marked as a No Show.\n\n🗓️ **Event Details**\n📍 **Meet 
 me for Dinner at: 6:15pm at Gull & Firkin\, 1943 Queen St. E.**\n\n**Meet 
 me for Ice cream at: 7:30pm at Beaches N Cream\, 2075 Queen St. E.**\n\n**
 Meet me for the Show at: 8:15pm in front of Kew Gardens at 2039 Queen St. 
 E.**\n🎬 **Movie Start Time:** **Sunset @ 8:42pm**\n⏱️ **Runtime:** 
 1 hour 55 mins\n🎟️ **Cost:** Free\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:*
 * [Click here to join](#)\n\n🎥 **A Quick Word About Movie Etiquette**\n
 We love a great film experience. Please:\n\n* Turn off your phone\n* Don
 ’t talk during the movie\n* Be respectful of others\n\nRepeat offenders 
 will be removed from the group — we take our cinema seriously (but with 
 snacks).\n\n👥 **About the Group**\nThis event is open to everyone — s
 ingle\, not single\, shy\, social\, new in town or a long-time local. We'r
 e a group for people who love movies *and* making real connections. We als
 o do walks\, hikes\, restaurants\, arts & culture — come be part of it!\
 n\n🎬 **Group** **Organized by:** Matthew\n📧 Questions? Reach out: **
 torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**
