SUMMARY:🎵🚗Niagara Falls ROAD TRIP TO SEE THE LEGENDARY BEACH BOYS! 
 🌊☀️🎶 $60 total
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎵
 🚗 ROAD TRIP TO SEE THE LEGENDARY BEACH BOYS! 🌊☀️🎶\n\nJoin us 
 for a fun summer road trip to the beautiful OLG Stage in Niagara Falls to 
 see one of the most iconic bands of all time — **The Beach Boys**!\nFor 
 just **$60 total**\, you'll get:\n✅ Concert ticket\n✅ Round-trip trans
 portation from Toronto\n✅ Good company and a great summer adventure\nWe'
 ll be traveling in style aboard a mighty **Kia Soul** equipped with **Siri
 usXM radio**\, so the road trip soundtrack is covered!\n\n📍 Meet: Outsi
 de Christie Station\n🕓 Departure: 4:00 PM sharp\n🎤 Concert Time: 7:3
 0 PM\n💵 Cost: $60 all-in\n\n🎟️ Event Details:\n[https://fallsviewc
 asinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/the-beach-boys.ht
 ml](https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-ev
 ents/the-beach-boys.html)\n\nDepending on traffic\, we may have time for a
  little sightseeing before the show. Either way\, expect a fun evening fil
 led with classic hits\, summer vibes\, and plenty of singalongs.\n🎶 "Wo
 uldn't It Be Nice"\n🎶 "Surfin' U.S.A."\n🎶 "California Girls"\n🎶 "
 Good Vibrations"\n…and many more!\n\n⚠️ Very limited spots available
 ! Once the car is full\, that's it.\nWe'll head back to Toronto immediatel
 y after the concert and should arrive back around **12:30 AM** (traffic pe
 rmitting).\nIf you've ever wanted to see a legendary band live without the
  hassle of driving yourself\, this is your chance.\nReserve your spot earl
 y and let's make it a beach party road trip to remember! 🏖️🎸😎
